WEBVTT

00:19:59.913 --> 00:20:02.829
Do you see them in an office with
cubicles or am I stretching,

00:20:03.413 --> 00:20:04.746
stretching this parallel too far?

00:20:04.996 --> 00:20:09.288
That's way too far. It's
a thing of the moment.

00:20:09.538 --> 00:20:13.204
We want to attack that guy over there.
You can't defeat him on your own.

00:20:13.204 --> 00:20:18.163
You look around, you see another male who
normally you don't have much time with,

00:20:18.496 --> 00:20:22.704
and you run over to him and you touch him
and you look at the high ranking one

00:20:22.871 --> 00:20:26.663
and the other male thinks, oh, this is an
opportunity to get the better of him.

00:20:26.663 --> 00:20:29.954
And so the two of them charge
or attack together.